<h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">AshAdmin</h1>
<p class="mt-2">
  The admin surface mounts here (ADR-0027) once the first Ash domain lands —
  M2's <code>Ops</code> domain (AccessRule, FeatureFlag). AshAdmin cannot
  render with zero domains, so this placeholder stands in until then.
</p>
<p class="mt-2 text-sm opacity-70">
  When <code>config :flux_vale, ash_domains:</code> gains its first entry, the
  router swaps this page for the real dashboard automatically.
</p>
